Remove a highlight you made, by its id. Preview with --dry-run; `mxr undo` puts it back. Highlights made in Marginalia are removed there

Usage: mxr reading unhighlight [OPTIONS] <HIGHLIGHT>

Arguments:
  <HIGHLIGHT>

Options:
      --dry-run
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
